{"id":95,"name":"التين","transliteration":"At-Tin","translation_fr":"Les figues","translation_en":"The Fig","type":"meccan","total_verses":8,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلتِّينِ وَٱلزَّيۡتُونِ","translation_fr":"Par le figuier et l'olivier","translation_en":"By the fig and the olive","transliteration":"Waaltteeni waalzzaytooni"},{"id":2,"text":"وَطُورِ سِينِينَ","translation_fr":"Et par le Mont Sînîn","translation_en":"And [by] Mount Sinai","transliteration":"Watoori seeneena"},{"id":3,"text":"وَهَٰذَا ٱلۡبَلَدِ ٱلۡأَمِينِ","translation_fr":"Et par cette Cité sûre","translation_en":"And [by] this secure city [Makkah]","transliteration":"Wahatha albaladi alameeni"},{"id":4,"text":"لَقَدۡ خَلَقۡنَا ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ فِيٓ أَحۡسَنِ تَقۡوِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Nous avons certes créé l'homme dans la forme la plus parfaite","translation_en":"We have certainly created man in the best of stature","transliteration":"Laqad khalaqna alinsana fee ahsani taqweemin"},{"id":5,"text":"ثُمَّ رَدَدۡنَٰهُ أَسۡفَلَ سَٰفِلِينَ","translation_fr":"Ensuite, Nous l'avons ramené au niveau le plus bas","translation_en":"Then We return him to the lowest of the low","transliteration":"Thumma radadnahu asfala safileena"},{"id":6,"text":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ فَلَهُمۡ أَجۡرٌ غَيۡرُ مَمۡنُونٖ","translation_fr":"sauf ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres: ceux-là auront une récompense jamais interrompue","translation_en":"Except for those who believe and do righteous deeds, for they will have a reward uninterrupted","transliteration":"Illa allatheena amanoo waAAamiloo alssalihati falahum ajrun ghayru mamnoonin"},{"id":7,"text":"فَمَا يُكَذِّبُكَ بَعۡدُ بِٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"Après cela, qu'est-ce qui te fait traiter la rétribution de mensonge","translation_en":"So what yet causes you to deny the Recompense","transliteration":"Fama yukaththibuka baAAdu bialddeeni"},{"id":8,"text":"أَلَيۡسَ ٱللَّهُ بِأَحۡكَمِ ٱلۡحَٰكِمِينَ","translation_fr":"Allah n'est-Il pas le plus sage des Juges","translation_en":"Is not Allah the most just of judges","transliteration":"Alaysa Allahu biahkami alhakimeena"}]}